#: ../../tools/vdjdb_tools.rst:32 f10a11ad01a0493b95eadb62a36b6063
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search VDJdb by epitope peptide sequence to find all "
"TCRs with confirmed specificity for a given antigen. Returns CDR3 "
"sequences, V/J gene usage, MHC restriction, and confidence scores for "
"TCRs recognizing the epitope. Filter by species, TCR chain, MHC class "
"(MHCI/MHCII), and minimum VDJdb confidence score (0-3). Connects to IEDB "
"epitope tools upstream and IMGT nomenclature downstream."
msgstr ""

